": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FUqxCuvNwoYQ7kNvwErjQjg&_nc_oc=AdqI3PeexXoqQLr33usDudczvNvKnXNNCpTgqMJZ_sg2pjy7CTGsDBqvt8TCj8rqsRk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPCZvnD7dGVx4lwHvBf5PWEHFSz9dXbvOhcx0m239b2Bg&oe=6AC1281B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hwFugy2te2IQ7kNvwGvnEJ-&_nc_oc=AdqMbn-W_xn9h-VDxRItMksGX5QaKCQ0dOLL_2bwAL5G1XpWxtqKB2oPMHWfxNOhAT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPKnuc5XCE93cIxey1lUYZak7tDVmyDb80JSUQuN3UYSg&oe=6AC11861"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EaDTVx1iZAUQ7kNvwF8V-S2&_nc_oc=Adqm7_OmZHL3ry57UZLRK4DBionHW_ibpqCUgPcu1Cfjc2t8XlPpuUIgy1v3oW5R1IM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO0cMGwODuGyZ5q5lIH2Happ0W15CpU3nH5NRTpMbdQiQ&oe=6AC1052F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ke64fQU4qKwQ7kNvwGdEgez&_nc_oc=Adp3J6m3yp9pIkINf9edokflhjXDtgOK_1P8zF95F50zezDXHrRiR_HPluvgbw-G5cU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPeQGNiZa5WylUruJ52yiBmXJM3eveOjEHBSzSCGOhG8w&oe=6AC104D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2PhGsZcRxCIQ7kNvwF8B9VO&_nc_oc=Adre2ZDJKL0acOhYVOj2HgeFVw4jpIpyKVKD7_3OZn_wqbTVEYaVNjt2pF_WZTOnrVs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMqnp6bhbL93bNa3EL2h3dYYHgti57EgUdpwkfkqgWDsQ&oe=6AC10E7D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a